WEBVTT

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:11.502
Choose Encoding in the side menu.

00:00:11.752 --> 00:00:17.752
Check that Updating live is shown.

00:00:18.401 --> 00:00:24.401
Check that Rivers of
Africa shows its progress.

00:00:25.919 --> 00:00:31.919
Check that It did not finish
explains why a video failed.

00:00:33.713 --> 00:00:38.777
Click Retry encoding Our Solar System.

00:00:39.027 --> 00:00:45.027
Wait until you see is back in the queue.
